      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The meta-carboxylation of arenes containing pyridine and other azine-directing groups is reported. Using carbon tetrabromide as the C1 source, ruthenium(III) trichloride catalysis enables functionalization of the arene meta-C-H position, affording carboxy methyl ester products after in situ reaction with methanol."},
